#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:5
#: 456b6a0ba14b4a228e3253785d16e48d
msgid "QuadPlane Frame setup"
msgstr "QuadPlane 机架设置"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:7
#: 4e5e92703a5d400885cf77c908e0c1d0
msgid ""
"The QuadPlane code supports several frame arrangements of quadcopter, "
"hexacopter, octacopter and octaquad multicopter frames which use lifting "
"motors in addition to the normal forward motor(s). Also configurations in "
"which the VTOL motors tilt for transitions or control, as well as choice "
"between horizontal VTOL stance or vertical (Tailsitters)."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 代码支持多种四旋翼、六旋翼、八旋翼和八轴四桨多旋翼机架排列，这些机架在常规前向电机之外额外使用升力电机。还支持 VTOL "
"电机倾转以实现切换或控制的构型，以及水平 VTOL 姿态或垂直（尾坐式）的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:11
#: c3dab05dfc364e2097ce0814ee081537
msgid "Tailsitters"
msgstr "尾坐式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:13
#: 2fa1a9e1c7dd40b1899e40cba3b64655
msgid ""
"Frame setup for Tailsitters is in this section: :ref:`guide-tailsitter`. "
"Once the frame is configured, proceed with the other :ref:`quadplane-setup` "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"尾坐式飞机的机架设置见此部分：:ref:`guide-tailsitter`。完成机架配置后，继续按照其他 :ref:`quadplane-setup`"
" 说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:16
#: de736dd112db4af2b5040acd834611ab
msgid "Plane VTOL Motor Configurations"
msgstr "Plane VTOL 电机构型"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:18
#: c6272e8e910a401f81620bea293b0a13
msgid ""
"These configurations add multicopter style lifting motors to a conventional "
"fixed wing configuration. Some or all of these motors may also be configured"
" as tilting motors to be used in fixed wing flight instead of the normal "
"fixed forward motor(s)."
msgstr "这些构型在传统固定翼构型基础上增加了多旋翼式升力电机。部分或全部电机也可配置为倾转电机，以便在固定翼飞行中替代常规固定前向电机使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:21
#: 59b8dcc2358044dcaa008379fd571bf1
msgid "Frame Types and Classes"
msgstr "机架类型与级别"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:23
#: d1f475fa84b6489a9745f68fdccd2919
msgid ""
"To use a different frame type you can set "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` and :ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>`."
msgstr ""
"要使用不同的机架类型，可设置 :ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>`。"

