#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:56
#: 9294ee58d13640e3891a02609811d34e
msgid "VTOL Motor Ordering"
msgstr "VTOL 电机排列顺序"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:58
#: 4b6eb9df890c498f91c1bf074241f42b
msgid ""
"The motor order and output channel is the same as for copter (see "
":ref:`Copter motor layout <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`) except that the"
" default output channel numbers usualy start at 5 instead of 1, since the "
"basic plane control surfaces are usually setup by default already on outputs"
" 1 thru 4 when Q_ENABLE is set to 1 and the autopilot rebooted to setup "
"QuadPlane."
msgstr ""
"电机顺序和输出通道与 Copter 相同（参见 :ref:`Copter 电机布局 <copter:connect-escs-and-"
"motors>`），不同之处在于默认输出通道编号通常从5开始而非1，因为当 Q_ENABLE 设为1且飞控重启以设置 QuadPlane "
"时，基本固定翼控制面通常已默认设置在输出1至4上。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:61
#: 105788afcf5540cd95172cb59d2f7944
msgid ""
":ref:`guide-tailsitter` configuration is a special case. See Tailsitter "
"notes below"
msgstr ":ref:`guide-tailsitter` 构型是特殊情况，请参阅下面的尾坐式注意事项。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:63
#: ef85fde052294f4d80915892e326fed8
msgid ""
"For example, with the default Quad-X frame the motors are on outputs 5 to 8."
" The arrangement is:"
msgstr "例如，采用默认 Quad-X 机架时，电机位于输出5至8。排列如下："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:66
#: fdcc17cca08b49eb930755baedf26b2e
msgid "**Output 5:** Motor 1 - Front right motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr "**输出5：** 电机1 - 右前电机，逆时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:67
#: 877c2b37d46a4c1e9fa8aa099915aaa2
msgid "**Output 6:** Motor 2 - Rear left motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr "**输出6：** 电机2 - 左后电机，逆时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:68
#: d533546ddc9c40b3b8af95bca6a7c7fe
msgid "**Output 7:** Motor 3 - Front left motor, clockwise"
msgstr "**输出7：** 电机3 - 左前电机，顺时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:69
#: a35a1ef735d84b83a8752231b8b3a7a3
msgid "**Output 8:** Motor 4 - Rear right motor, clockwise"
msgstr "**输出8：** 电机4 - 右后电机，顺时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:71
#: 5fbfdb0f560245c6925cf00cdae39e72
msgid ""
"You can remember the clockwise/counter-clockwise rule by \"motors turn in "
"towards the fuselage\", except for the H configuration, there all directions"
" are inverted!"
msgstr "记住顺/逆时针规律的方法是「电机向机身方向旋转」，但 H 型构型例外，所有方向均相反！"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:74
#: 93829fce412d4a9cb37fb29e5fd9221a
msgid ""
"Another common setup is an OctoQuad X8, which uses the following ordering"
msgstr "另一种常见设置是 OctoQuad X8，采用以下顺序："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:76
#: c9e5339986a1480f8ce8a7c28079f0d8
msgid "**Output 5:** Motor 1 - Front right top motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr "**输出5：** 电机1 - 右前上层电机，逆时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:77
#: 99900d09e08d49a78b6b4faba44c3413
msgid "**Output 6:** Motor 2 - Front left top motor, clockwise"
msgstr "**输出6：** 电机2 - 左前上层电机，顺时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:78
#: 2ed2a0bb35e54eafa7b0c2860a3d47de
msgid "**Output 7:** Motor 3 - Rear left top motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr "**输出7：** 电机3 - 左后上层电机，逆时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:79
#: 85002db2fbc6446ba1c5b8d0f9dbe243
msgid "**Output 8:** Motor 4 - Rear right top motor, clockwise"
msgstr "**输出8：** 电机4 - 右后上层电机，顺时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:80
#: 2c8eeb76a64942958706d3a5b77beafd
msgid "**Output 9:** Motor 5 - Front left bottom motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr "**输出9：** 电机5 - 左前下层电机，逆时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:81
#: e5234fdb5ff44bfd8b50d382c63f1cba
msgid "**Output 10:** Motor 6 - Front right bottom motor, clockwise"
msgstr "**输出10：** 电机6 - 右前下层电机，顺时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:82
#: 52228a5333034ac68c25b4e768943cb3
msgid "**Output 11:** Motor 7 - Rear right bottom motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr "**输出11：** 电机7 - 右后下层电机，逆时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:83
#: c9a4014ccf1f4a3bb880042e1e3f7753
msgid "**Output 12:** Motor 8 - Rear left bottom motor, clockwise"
msgstr "**输出12：** 电机8 - 左后下层电机，顺时针"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:85
#: eb08483282a74f61895f29d83c2c979a
msgid ""
"You can remember the clockwise/counter-clockwise rule for an octa-quad by "
"\"top motors turn in towards the fuselage, bottom motors turn out away from "
"the fuselage\"."
msgstr "记住 octa-quad 顺/逆时针规律的方法是「上层电机向机身方向旋转，下层电机远离机身方向旋转」。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:89
#: 8d1063c7beed48a3ab5dc269f9ca0cb8
msgid "For a Tricopter configuration, the default output assignment is:"
msgstr "对于三旋翼构型，默认输出分配如下："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:91
#: e4e9c7e9835c4bb3bbfdb6e6a70e381a
msgid "**Output 5:** Motor 1 - Front right motor, looking from above"
msgstr "**输出5：** 电机1 - 右前电机（从上方看）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:92
#: 585e130a84ca4377bf61783dc7f76943
msgid "**Output 6:** Motor 2 - Front left motor"
msgstr "**输出6：** 电机2 - 左前电机"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:93
#: ed27bf935589486cb7a715c8f800b6ed
msgid "**Output 8:** Motor 4 - Rear motor"
msgstr "**输出8：** 电机4 - 尾部电机"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:94
#: 136941da33654b72b3220c4d7bcf5245
msgid "**Output 11:** Motor 7 - Tail Tilt Servo (see below)"
msgstr "**输出11：** 电机7 - 尾部倾转舵机（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:96
#: 114d5896caa04edb8ad2814a3aa2f1c3
msgid ""
"The normal plane outputs are assumed to be on 1 to 4 as usual. Only vertical"
" lift outputs (5 to 8 on a quad setup) normally should be run at high PWM "
"rate (400Hz). When using these default configurations, you can assigne other"
" outputs to whatever functions you desire."
msgstr ""
"普通固定翼输出通常位于1至4。只有垂直升力输出（四旋翼设置中的5至8）通常应以高 PWM "
"频率（400Hz）运行。使用这些默认配置时，可以将其他输出分配给任何所需功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:100
#: 8e84b589bde74642923287a2d960d1bf
msgid ""
"You can optionally move the motors to be on any other channel, using the "
"procedure outlined in the section further below."
msgstr "您也可以按照下面进一步说明的流程，将电机移至其他任意通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:103
#: fc2b21e52b47476c986792a5dd4541ba
msgid "Tricopter"
msgstr "三旋翼"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:105
#: a90c4605d2374e81aff3db1fce650141
msgid ""
"Frame Type 7 is Tricopter and can be either non-Tiltrotor, or a "
":ref:`Tiltrotor<guide-tilt-rotor>` configuration for the front motors, but "
"using a separate servo to sideways tilt the rear motor for yaw control, or a"
" :ref:`Tiltrotor<guide-tilt-rotor>` using Vectored Yaw control via the front"
" tilting motors."
msgstr ""
"机架类型7为三旋翼，可以是非倾转旋翼型，也可以是前电机采用 :ref:`倾转旋翼<guide-tilt-rotor>` "
"构型、后电机使用独立舵机进行侧向倾转以实现偏航控制，或使用前倾转电机实现矢量偏航控制的 :ref:`倾转旋翼<guide-tilt-rotor>` "
"构型。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:107
#: 203993d979704e6d8ee136653c064d39
msgid ""
"If using a tilting yaw control, an output is setup as Motor 7 "
"(``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` = 39) for a servo-controlled sideways tilt mechanism "
"for the yaw motor, Motor 4. You should set up the yaw servo’s maximum lean "
"angle in degrees with :ref:`Q_M_YAW_SV_ANGLE<Q_M_YAW_SV_ANGLE>` to prevent "
"prop strikes to the ground or frame. This lean angle assumes that "
"``SERVOn_MIN`` and ``SERVOn_MAX``, represent +/- 90 degrees, with "
"``SERVOn_TRIM`` representing 0 degrees lean."
msgstr ""
"如果使用倾转偏航控制，需将一个输出设置为电机7（``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` = 39），用于偏航电机（电机4）的舵机控制侧向倾转机构。应通过"
" :ref:`Q_M_YAW_SV_ANGLE<Q_M_YAW_SV_ANGLE>` "
"设置偏航舵机的最大倾斜角度（度数），以防止螺旋桨触地或撞到机架。该倾斜角假设 ``SERVOn_MIN`` 和 ``SERVOn_MAX`` "
"代表±90度，``SERVOn_TRIM`` 代表0度倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:109
#: bdcb9d1ee607416abfefeeb1de96f3b7
msgid ""
"the rear motor tilt servo is not affected by :ref:`Q_TILT_MASK<Q_TILT_MASK>`"
" or any other :ref:`Tiltrotor<guide-tilt-rotor>` related parameters since it"
" is not involved with vertical or horizontal propulsion, only yaw control."
msgstr ""
"后电机倾转舵机不受 :ref:`Q_TILT_MASK<Q_TILT_MASK>` 或任何其他 :ref:`倾转旋翼<guide-tilt-"
"rotor>` 相关参数的影响，因为它不涉及垂直或水平推进，仅用于偏航控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:112
#: b4a70996aa7b4fdb8ed80492f3b728d1
msgid "Tilt-Rotors"
msgstr "倾转旋翼"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:114
#: dd34a39862e14728906e2cbabcedcf43
msgid "See :ref:`guide-tilt-rotor`"
msgstr "参见 :ref:`guide-tilt-rotor`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:117
#: c0de37049c4949feb05fbbb31d9cdf5e
msgid "Using different channel mappings"
msgstr "使用不同通道映射"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:119
#: 2341c83cba6041f9af643edb85e7593c
msgid ""
"You can remap what output channels the lifting motors are on by setting "
"values for SERVOn_FUNCTION. This follows the same approach as :ref:`other "
"output functions <common-rcoutput-mapping>`."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过设置 SERVOn_FUNCTION 值来重新映射升力电机所在的输出通道。这与 :ref:`其他输出功能 <common-rcoutput-"
"mapping>` 的方式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:123
#: cfb01f7c70414267a0b19aadee8504ec
msgid ""
"Note that you do not need to set any of the SERVOn_FUNCTION values unless "
"you have a non-standard motor ordering, using vectored thrust, or are a "
"Tailsitter. It is highly recommended that you use the standard ordering and "
"do not set the SERVOn_FUNCTION parameters, leaving them at zero. They will "
"be automatically set to the right values for your frame on boot."
msgstr ""
"注意，除非您使用非标准电机排列、矢量推力或尾坐式飞机，否则无需设置任何 SERVOn_FUNCTION 值。强烈建议使用标准排列，不要设置 "
"SERVOn_FUNCTION 参数，保持为零。启动时系统将自动为您的机架设置正确的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:129
#: 36ea7cf65a1d428eb3eca83245430104
